  "description": "Scheduled firehose ingestion \u2014 polls the AT Protocol PDS/AppView every 5 minutes for SwapPulse custom-lexicon records from the local repo and followed remote DIDs, ingesting creates/updates/deletes into the local DB so feeds blend local + remote records in real time.",
